EngineSave portable marker

While this file sits next to EngineSave.exe, the window keeps its settings and logs in the
"config" folder here, so the whole folder can be moved or copied to another computer.
Delete this file to use %APPDATA%\EngineSave instead.

这个文件在 EngineSave.exe 旁边时，图形界面的设置与日志保存在这里的 config 文件夹，
整个文件夹可以移动或复制到另一台电脑。删除它则改用 %APPDATA%\EngineSave。
